; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Industry assignment for Banyu Langit symbols.
;
; Ticker,SectorName,IndustryName - sector FIRST, and that order matters.
; Per the vendor docs, INDUSTRYNAME creates the industry AND, when SECTORNAME is
; also present, attaches that industry to the given sector. Sending the industry
; without its sector would leave 190 industries unattached, and AmiBroker derives
; a symbol's sector from its industry - so the sector list would stay wrong.
;
; $OVERWRITE 1: the symbols already exist from the quote import.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
$FORMAT Ticker,SectorName,IndustryName
$SEPARATOR ,
$SKIPLINES 0
$NOQUOTES 1
$OVERWRITE 1
$AUTOADD 0
$BREAKONERR 1
$DEBUG 1
